  {
   "key": "m-iii-12",
   "text": "The work before you\nIII.12",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 640,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"If thou workest at that which is before thee, following right reason seriously, vigorously, calmly\"\n\nIII.12, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-iv-31",
   "text": "Love your craft\nIV.31",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 940,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Love the art, poor as it may be, which thou hast learned, and be content with it\"\n\nIV.31, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-iv-49",
   "text": "The promontory\nIV.49",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 940,
    "y": 334,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Be like the promontory against which the waves continually break, but it stands firm\"\n\nIV.49, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-v-20",
      "label": "standing firm, then using the blow"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-v-1",
   "text": "Why get up\nV.1",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 1240,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"In the morning when thou risest unwillingly, let this thought be present,--I am rising to the work of a human being.\"\n\nV.1, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-ii-1",
      "label": "two ways to start a morning"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-v-20",
   "text": "The obstacle becomes the way\nV.20",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 1240,
    "y": 334,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"the mind converts and changes every hindrance to its activity into an aid\"\n\nV.20, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-iv-49",
      "label": "standing firm, then using the blow"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vi-30",
   "text": "Don't become a Caesar\nVI.30",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 1540,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Take care that thou art not made into a Caesar, that thou art not dyed with this dye\"\n\nVI.30, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vi-54",
   "text": "Swarm and bee\nVI.54",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 1540,
    "y": 334,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"That which is not good for the swarm, neither is it good for the bee.\"\n\nVI.54, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-ix-29",
   "text": "Not Plato's Republic\nIX.29",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 2440,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"nor yet expect Plato's Republic: but be content if the smallest thing goes on well\"\n\nIX.29, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-x-16",
      "label": "stop theorising, act"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-x-16",
   "text": "Stop talking, be good\nX.16",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 2740,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"No longer talk at all about the kind of man that a good man ought to be, but be such.\"\n\nX.16, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-ix-29",
      "label": "stop theorising, act"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-xii-17",
   "text": "If it's not right\nXII.17",
   "group": "duty",
   "box": {
    "x": 3340,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "blue",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"If it is not right, do not do it: if it is not true, do not say it.\"\n\nXII.17, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-i-1",
   "text": "Grandfather Verus\nI.1",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 40,
    "y": 624,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"From my grandfather Verus [I learned] good morals and the government of my temper.\"\n\nI.1, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-i-7",
   "text": "Rusticus\nI.7",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 40,
    "y": 748,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"From Rusticus I received the impression that my character required improvement and discipline\"\n\nI.7, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-ii-1",
   "text": "You'll meet difficult people\nII.1",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 340,
    "y": 624,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Begin the morning by saying to thyself, I shall meet with the busybody, the ungrateful, arrogant, deceitful, envious, unsocial.\"\n\nII.1, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-v-1",
      "label": "two ways to start a morning"
     },
     {
      "key": "m-vii-22",
      "label": "expect the worst, and love them anyway"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vi-6",
   "text": "The best revenge\nVI.6",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 1540,
    "y": 624,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"The best way of avenging thyself is not to become like [the wrong-doer].\"\n\nVI.6, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vii-22",
   "text": "Love those who wrong you\nVII.22",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 1840,
    "y": 624,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"It is peculiar to man to love even those who do wrong.\"\n\nVII.22, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-ii-1",
      "label": "expect the worst, and love them anyway"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vii-73",
   "text": "No reward needed\nVII.73",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 1840,
    "y": 748,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"When thou hast done a good act and another has received it, why dost thou still look for a third thing\"\n\nVII.73, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-viii-59",
   "text": "For one another\nVIII.59",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 2140,
    "y": 624,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Men exist for the sake of one another.\"\n\nVIII.59, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-xii-4",
   "text": "Others' opinion of us\nXII.4",
   "group": "others",
   "box": {
    "x": 3340,
    "y": 624,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "orange",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"every man loves himself more than all the rest of men, but yet sets less value on his own opinion of himself than on the opinion of others.\"\n\nXII.4, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-ii-15",
   "text": "All is opinion\nII.15",
   "group": "judgment",
   "box": {
    "x": 340,
    "y": 1038,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "violet",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Remember that all is opinion.\"\n\nII.15, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-iv-3",
   "text": "Life is opinion\nIV.3",
   "group": "judgment",
   "box": {
    "x": 940,
    "y": 1038,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "violet",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"The universe is transformation: life is opinion.\"\n\nIV.3, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-iv-7",
   "text": "Take away the harm\nIV.7",
   "group": "judgment",
   "box": {
    "x": 940,
    "y": 1162,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "violet",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Take away thy opinion, and then there is taken away the complaint, \"I have been harmed.\"\"\n\nIV.7, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-viii-47",
      "label": "the same claim, restated"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-v-16",
   "text": "Dyed by your thoughts\nV.16",
   "group": "judgment",
   "box": {
    "x": 1240,
    "y": 1038,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "violet",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Such as are thy habitual thoughts, such also will be the character of thy mind; for the soul is dyed by the thoughts.\"\n\nV.16, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-viii-47",
   "text": "Your judgment hurts\nVIII.47",
   "group": "judgment",
   "box": {
    "x": 2140,
    "y": 1038,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "violet",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"If thou art pained by any external thing, it is not this thing that disturbs thee, but thy own judgment about it.\"\n\nVIII.47, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-iv-7",
      "label": "the same claim, restated"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-ii-14",
   "text": "All you can lose\nII.14",
   "group": "present",
   "box": {
    "x": 340,
    "y": 1452,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "green",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"the present is the only thing of which a man can be deprived\"\n\nII.14, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-iii-10",
   "text": "An indivisible point\nIII.10",
   "group": "present",
   "box": {
    "x": 640,
    "y": 1452,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "green",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"every man lives only this present time, which is an indivisible point\"\n\nIII.10, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-viii-36",
      "label": "shrink the problem to now"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vii-8",
   "text": "Don't fear the future\nVII.8",
   "group": "present",
   "box": {
    "x": 1840,
    "y": 1452,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "green",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Let not future things disturb thee\"\n\nVII.8, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-vii-29",
   "text": "Confine yourself\nVII.29",
   "group": "present",
   "box": {
    "x": 1840,
    "y": 1576,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "green",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Confine thyself to the present.\"\n\nVII.29, tr. George Long"
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-viii-36",
   "text": "Not your whole life\nVIII.36",
   "group": "present",
   "box": {
    "x": 2140,
    "y": 1452,
    "w": 250,
    "h": 96
   },
   "style": {
    "color": "green",
    "fill": "semi",
    "dash": "solid",
    "geo": "rectangle",
    "size": "m"
   },
   "meta": {
    "detail": "\"Do not disturb thyself by thinking of the whole of thy life.\"\n\nVIII.36, tr. George Long",
    "see": [
     {
      "key": "m-iii-10",
      "label": "shrink the problem to now"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "key": "m-ii-11",
   "text": "You could die now\nII.11",
   "group": "death",
   "box": {
